      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `speech_client.py` file, I need to write the necessary code for local configuration and client helper utilities for Streaming Speech-to-Text. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task, as it is a concrete third-party managed service. </thinking>\n\n",
