      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create stream_with_language.py in the current working directory.\nTask: starts a streaming recognizer with language and punctuation settings.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc418aea001UjnYKEVrfqQ2s0",
