      "time_updated": 1789864808299
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file with the specified functionality, I need to choose a concrete external provider for speech recognition. Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API is a suitable choice as it allows for streaming recognition with specific language and punctuation settings. I will import the necessary modules from the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text SDK and use the specific client class and environment variable to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864811141,
          "start": 1789864808301
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc418f6d001uInsNTkrgt4TRF",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc418aed00189SRAQv1egQZsw",
      "session_id": "ses_f43be7521ffeY6z42iuinT0RYK",
